    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f61173f485cd1609a14a588a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在出道前接受了无数的训练，\n但跑3000米时还是跑出很不稳定的成绩。\n就是那一天的资料。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9d70008fd40dd9b226057cedce7f065d17d269cb9e758d76116bca6c31baa43",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
