      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "过去美浦波旁为了说服以短途马\n为目标在培育她的前任训练员──",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ad935bd5a962f5bbf4c9ccd5e8ce8d0548c8488b8379eeeda82a5011a7ae8a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95bf06d9deb05bd0e1b759c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训也已经过了一半。\n就在大家为了下一场比赛努力锻炼时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "18231e0a05e6b8564e148c1798b08379cfc9abf47c58c08d57a248990207faef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026104.json",
